.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="The classic CLRS flow network: finds the maximum flow from source to sink, and confirms the max-flow min-cut theorem -- the minimum cut&#x27;s capacity exactly equals the maximum flow value.">

