    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Runs Dijkstra&#x27;s algorithm from one source on a small weighted graph and draws the resulting shortest-path tree. Bellman-Ford gives the same distances there, and takes over on a graph with a negative edge, where Dijkstra&#x27;s greedy assumption breaks down.">

